      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-294524",
      ":question/problem": "A librarian recorded the number of books read by each student in a reading club. The results are shown in the table below.\n\n| Student | Books read |\n| --- | ---: |\n| 1 | $5$ |\n| 2 | $8$ |\n| 3 | $6$ |\n| 4 | $9$ |\n| 5 | $4$ |\n| 6 | $7$ |\n| 7 | $10$ |\n\nWhat is the range of the number of books read among the $7$ students?"
